---

<section class="plants">
  <div class="plants__container">
    <div class="plants__content">
      <h2 class="plants__title" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1500">
        讓日常每一步<br />
        成為改變的力量
      </h2>
      <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1500" data-aos-delay="200">
        聯合線上實踐聯合國永續發展目標SDG17「建立多元夥伴關係」，攜手高雄市愛種樹協會與健康促進平台Walkii，積極推動環境保護與職場健康，鼓勵上班族培養運動習慣，同時為地球盡一份心力。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="plants__img" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="1000">
      <img src="/public/imgs/planttrees.png" alt="Plants Image" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @import '../style/_variable.scss';
  .plants {
    &__container {
      background-color: $BGColor;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-end;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1765px;
    }
    &__content {
      background-color: $mainColor;
      border-top-left-radius: 100px;
      height: 820px;
      flex: 0 1 486px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: justify;
      padding: 60px 83px;

      h2 {
        font-size: 25px;
        color: $whiteColor;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 20px;
        color: $fontColor;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }
    }
    &__img {
      flex: 1;
      border-top-left-radius: 100px;
      height: 1026px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, #fefefe -60%, #ebebd4 100%);
      // background-image: url('/public/imgs/planttrees.png');
      // background-size: contain;
      // background-position: center;
      // background-repeat: no-repeat;
      img {
        border-top-left-radius: 100px;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
